iig-port tests
==============

Run the full test archive from the repository root:

    tests/run.sh

The test archive contains input .iig files and Xcode 26.3 (DriverKit-440)
reference outputs. The test builds iig.cpp, regenerates all outputs, and
compares the generated headers, implementation sources, and edits with the
reference files.

Set XNU_SRC to an existing XNU checkout to avoid cloning:

    XNU_SRC=/path/to/xnu tests/run.sh

If XNU_SRC is not set, the test archive's prepare script clones the public XNU
repository at the Apple xnu revision recorded in the archive
(f6217f891ac0bb64f3d375211650a4c1ff8ca1ea, xnu-12377.1.9).
